{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30354","headline":"宛陵寓居上沈大夫二首 二 · 赵嘏","name":"宛陵寓居上沈大夫二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪树参差绿可攀，谢家云水满东山。\n能忘天上他年贵，来结林中一日闲。\n醉叩玉盘歌褭褭，暖鸣幽涧鸟关关。\n觥筹不尽须归去，路在春风缥缈间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}